                                     "text":  "Great tasting Tonkatsu, using special 五花肉 and dark chocolate in the curry sauce. Flavorful!\nIt’s a new restaurant in the neighborhood. Each main course about $400NTD.\nLess one star because they only served room-temperature tea, instead of hot tea! But that’s a small factor. Will return to fine here again.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
