                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJKcezcQCtQjQR1ApWkMx-oag/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN2aHZMbzlRRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "We ordered the tenderloin pork cutlet. I find it easy to eat and not fatty at all, perfect for those who doesn\u0027t like it too oily. The radish and cutlet sauce cuts through the richness and oil of the meat which was a nice touch. The curry sauce was my favorite with a strong pepper taste that grows with every bite.\nWe were told beforehand to eat it asap since it\u0027s fried goods. The restaurant itself looks very well renovated with a cozy ambience and a strong curry smell when you first walk in.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
